### Project Purpose and Objectives
Purpose: The purpose of this project is to ensure critical business operation continuity by upgrading a legacy bioinformatics production software suite that is central to our bioinformatics pipeline. This upgrade will improve performance, maintainability, and scalability by re-engineering the software in a modern programming language and deploying it in a modern cloud environment. This upgrade will also enhance user experience and new user onboarding by streamlining the process for data analysis and report generation.

### Objectives
- Map the core functionality infrastructure and define the scope within 1-1.5 months (completed).
- Migration and optimize of all core functionalities to Python within 4 months, meanwhile reengineering it for better performance and maintainability; implement CI/CD during the migration (completed).
- Containerize the migrated core functionalities and deploy the application on AWS, ensuring it meets performance benchmarks within 1 month (completed).
- Develop and deploy a UI for easy user access, with security and authentication checkpoints embedded (ongoing).
- Test the application thoroughly with production work projects and provide feedback; incorporate and implement improvements based on feedback (ongoing).
- Reduce manual interaction with the suite by 70% through process streamlining. Ensure maintainability through code modularization and comprehensive documentation (completed). 

